WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.067
Rare rebuke.

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.335
Israel's foreign ministry

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.136
today is slamming

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:05.372
Elon Musk's recent series of tweets,

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.906
saying they have a, quote, anti-Semitic

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.208
feeling to it.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:08.975
Yesterday, Musk

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.710
launched a baseless Twitter attack

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.945
against George Soros,

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.847
the progressive Jewish philanthropist

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:14.314
who's often

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:16.316
the target of antisemitic conspiracy

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:16.583
theories.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.550
Musk tweeted

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.020
that Soros reminds him of Magneto

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.689
a comic book super villain.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.224
Both, of course,

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.425
Soros and Magneto

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:29.195
are Holocaust survivors and Jewish.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.764
Musk's reply

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:31.131
He wrote,

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.832
Soros does not have good intentions and,

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:33.700
quote, wants to erode

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.402
the very fabric of civilization.

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.338
Soros hates humanity, unquote.

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.507
Obviously, it's not

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.375
necessarily anti-Semitic to criticize

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.143
George Soros,

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:46.346
but the tweets do engage,

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:48.214
critics say, in tropes

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.116
that Jews are falsely cast

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.217
as evil masterminds

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.652
set out to harm the masses.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.187
Here to discuss, Sarah Fischer,

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.755
CNN media analyst and Axios

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:56.489
senior media reporter,

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:56.890
along with Ted

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.590
Deutch is CEO

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.925
of the American Jewish Committee,

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.393
a former Democratic congressman

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:00.827
from Florida.

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:01.594
So Sarah

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.363
Musk didn't say what prompted the attack,

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:04.531
but you can't ignore the timing

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:06.366
that Soros recently disclosed.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:06.866
He had sold

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.436
his entire holdings of stock in Tesla

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.171
which of course, is owned by Musk.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.106
We're used to seeing

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:15.608
controversial comments from Musk.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.676
Were you surprised by this?

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.012
I wasn't surprised by this.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:19.412
Jake.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.915
Musk has repeatedly engaged

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.283
in far right conspiracies.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:23.850
You'll recall

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.085
with the Paul Pelosi attack,

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:25.652
he tweeted out

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:27.420
misinformation around that.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.255
But I think it is important to note

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:29.989
that Elon

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.224
Musk, who still runs

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.460
a publicly traded business and Tesla

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.594
is going to have to be mindful

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:35.061
of the fact

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:35.995
that any time he's

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.397
going to pick on someone online

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:38.698
for dumping his stock

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:39.833
he risks other people

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.167
wanting to come in and buy it.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.702
And so, you know, as a business person,

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.304
this is not the strongest move.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:46.039
But Musk has long sort of held

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:46.639
some of these,

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:47.941
you know, more Republican, right

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.209
leaning beliefs.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:50.944
Shortly after he took over Twitter,

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.979
he allowed a bunch of accounts

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:53.880
back on the platform

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.647
that had been banned,

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.749
including some neo-Nazi accounts.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.551
And so to hear this type of rhetoric

00:01:58.551 --> 00:01:59.619
coming from Elon Musk, it's

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:00.653
not totally shocking.

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:04.090
Ted Deutch, former Congressman Deutsch,

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.893
obviously criticizing

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:07.127
George

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.496
Soros is not inherently anti-Semitic.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.264
What did you think of this?

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:12.966
Did you think comparing him to Magneto,

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.601
who is an evil super villain,

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.102
who was also like George Soros,

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.670
Jewish and Holocaust survivor,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.905
saying that he hates humanity?

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.674
Did that cross a line for you

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.943
Sure, of course it did, Jake.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.678
No, it's not.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:28.181
It's not unacceptable to criticize George

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:29.549
Soros or anyone else,

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:32.018
but it is clearly not an accident.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:35.455
When you compare him to a cartoon villain

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.190
who, like George

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.393
Soros, survived the Warsaw ghetto

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:44.297
and Auschwitz the tweet about this notion

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.932
that Soros

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:46.866
hates humanity

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:47.233
is trying

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:47.934
to destroy

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.202
civilizations plays

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:49.903
into the

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.538
classic anti-Semitic

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:53.673
conspiracy theory about

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.176
about Jewish wealth and power.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:59.279
And we've seen anti-Semitism surge

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:01.080
since Musk took over,

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.248
took over Twitter

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:03.383
We've seen massive cuts

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.485
to the moderation team at Twitter.

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:07.720
And our own survey showed that

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.790
two thirds of Jews have experienced

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:11.291
the attack.

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:12.125
Technologies are seeing

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.226
anti-Semitism online.

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:15.261
85% of those under 30

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:16.095
and people feel

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.997
physically threatened as a result.

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:19.265
There are repercussions

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.334
when you do things like this.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.936
It's it's unacceptable.

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:23.970
It's dangerous.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.038
And it plays into these

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:26.873
classic conspiracy theories

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.441
that are inherently anti-Semitic.

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.610
And, you know, it's interesting

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:31.110
in terms

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.146
of how Elon Musk has as chosen

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:34.914
to run the platform.

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:38.318
He is constantly engaging with people

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.720
who are bad faith actors.

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:42.855
I mean, people who subscribe to Q

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:43.623
and on people

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:44.724
who are

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:46.292
white supremacists, people

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:47.093
who are

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:49.295
focused on black on white violence.

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:50.029
I mean, he's

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.264
people who criticize

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:53.566
his diversity in Hollywood casting.

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:55.935
I mean, these are choices he's making.

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:56.869
Yeah.

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:57.604
And there's surprising

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:58.371
choices, Jake,

00:03:58.371 --> 00:03:59.973
because Twitter has been marked down

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.707
by analysts.

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:02.575
It's hemorrhaging its ad revenue.

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:03.710
And so Elon Musk,

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.410
you would think

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.812
as the CEO of this company

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:06.579
who said,

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:06.980
by the way,

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.281
that he wants to manage costs

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:08.681
to ensure

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:09.749
that it's profitable,

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:10.850
would be very mindful

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:11.751
of the misinformation

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:12.986
that he puts out there

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:13.886
and the types of accounts

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.121
that he engages with

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.055
because he wants to bring those

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.323
advertisers back.

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:18.691
Well, when we talk to agency

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:19.492
executives, people

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:20.360
who are buying ads

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.461
on behalf of Fortune five,

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:23.463
hundred brands and smaller companies,

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.397
they will tell you that

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:26.366
they have to caution their clients

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.401
when it comes to buying ads on Twitter,

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:29.269
not just because

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.637
of some of the content moderation

00:04:30.637 --> 00:04:31.537
going down

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:33.573
but also because of Elon Musk himself

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:34.674
spewing misinformation.

00:04:34.674 --> 00:04:35.708
So it's puzzling to me

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.310
why he continues to do this

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.578
and to behave this way.

00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:39.212
But hopefully

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:40.947
now that they have a new CEO

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:42.482
you know, an advertising executive

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:43.516
with a lot of experience,

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:44.917
maybe she can bring him in.

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:46.519
So how

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.389
Congressman Deutsch,

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:52.158
your governor DeSantis, Ron DeSantis

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:55.094
frequently criticizes George Soros.

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:56.262
I mean, it is something he does.

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:57.697
It's something that a lot of people do

00:04:57.697 --> 00:04:59.098
because he puts a lot of money

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:00.099
into progressive causes.

00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:01.801
Including progressive districts.

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:02.935
Attorney.

00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:04.404
Would you argue that

00:05:04.404 --> 00:05:05.972
that is inherently anti-Semitic?

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:08.241
I mean, how would. Go ahead.

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:10.677
It's yeah, Jake, I don't want to pass

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.213
tweets and criticism of George Soros.

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:16.215
I think we have to acknowledge

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:19.385
in this in this instance that comparing

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:22.855
George Souris to a Holocaust Survivor

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:26.492
cartoon villain is not an accident,

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:27.460
but it's not.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.494
I also don't want to miss

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:30.263
the opportunity, Jake, to point out

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:31.998
that as we're having this conversation,

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:32.832
the White House

00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:34.467
is working on a national action plan

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:36.269
to combat anti-Semitism.

00:05:36.269 --> 00:05:37.704
I hope that it calls

00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:39.405
for greater transparency

00:05:39.405 --> 00:05:39.972
at all

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:42.241
the social media companies and access

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:44.143
to the algorithms and the ability

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:45.812
to share their community standards

00:05:45.812 --> 00:05:47.714
so that the world understands

00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:48.881
that anti-Semitism

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:50.083
is not acceptable

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:52.485
on any social media sites.

00:05:52.485 --> 00:05:52.752
All right.

00:05:52.752 --> 00:05:53.720
Ted Deutch, Sarah Fisher,

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:54.620
thanks to both you for joining.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.054
Appreciate.

